{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想搬家、斷捨離或整理家居時，往往記不起物品放在哪裡，甚至重複購買同一件東西。ItemNote 讓你按房間、儲物櫃或自訂區域記錄家中每件物品，隨時以名稱、標籤或位置搜尋，也方便準備租屋與外借物品。此工具原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合注重收納與物品管理的用戶。</p>\n\n<h2>房間標籤快速搜尋物品</h2>\n<p>ItemNote 讓你以照片、數量與價值建立家中物品清單，並按房間、車房或自訂區域標示存放位置，配合分類標籤快速篩選。借出物品可記錄何人何時借走並設定歸還提醒，願望清單與保養到期通知同樣兼備。內置統計顯示物品總數與總值，離線運作且無需註冊帳號，資料只留在裝置上。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-108-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-109-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-110-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-111-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-112-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Home Stuff Inventory Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T21:58:28.242829+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}